    "title": "Creating a simpler guide to buying funeral services",
    "excerpt": "<p>We rewrote the guide people get when buying funeral services, often after the death of a loved one. Project scope Partner Methods The opportunity The Cemetery and Funeral Bureau (CFB) regulates funeral businesses. This includes funeral homes, cemeteries, and crematories. These businesses must give customers CFB’s Consumer Guide to Funeral &amp; Cemetery Purchases. The guide &#8230; <a title=\"Creating a simpler guide to buying funeral services\" class=\"read-more\" href=\"https://live-digital-ca-gov.pantheonsite.io/our-work/projects/creating-simpler-guide-buying-funeral-services/\" aria-label=\"More on Creating a simpler guide to buying funeral services\">Read more</a></p>\n",
